'''Ururun Wolf''' (ウルフとウルルン, ''Urufu to Ururun'', '''Wolf and Ururun''') is a [[:Category:Traitless Enemies|Traitless]] enemy that appears in [[Legend Stages]]. She was added in [[Version 2.3 Update#Version 2.3.1 Update|Version 2.3.1]].

{{Enemy Info
|name = Ururun Wolf
|image = E 045.png
|first appearance = '''SoL''': [[The Great Escaper|Sub-chapter 18 - The Great Escaper]]
|latest appearance = '''ZL''': [[Sacrifice Apprenticeship|Sub-chapter 4 - Sacrifice Apprenticeship]]
|money drop = 1,400¢ - 5,530¢
}}

==Enemy==
Ururun Wolf is a backliner with high health, slow movement speed, and a slow attack animation with decent attack power. She has a large amount of knockbacks, which greatly contribute to her survivability.

